WELLMETE Desk Mount for Racing Sim Shifter & Handbrake - Compatible with Thrustmaster TSS Handbrake Sparco Mod & TH8A Shifter, Logitech G Driving Force Shifter - Heavy Duty Metal Adjustable Desk Mount for Shifter and Handbrake
Heavy Duty Metal:
These desk mount for racing sim shifter & handbrake are made with heavy duty meatl, which can provide you stable gaming handling and experience;
Compatibility:
WellMete desk mount shifter and handbrake can fully compatible with both Logitech and Thrustmaster racing sim shifter and handbrake;
Adjustable:
The quick release clamp can be adjusted to fix different thickness desk(Max 5.9 Inches),both the shifter and handbrake plate can be adjusted up and down to provide you the best handling position you need;
Non-slip & Protect Desk:
There is a silicone pad under the top plate to protect your desk and provide non-slip and stable gaming experience;
Shifter Position:
The shifter can be installed on the left side or right side of the bracket according to your habit.
With WELLMETE Shifter and Handbrake Desk Mount you can get much better gaming handling experience. Just enjoy your game with it !
